@startuml
!include _style.iuml
top to bottom direction
rectangle "表示层／界面表示包\nWorkspaceUI · SourceUI · FeedUI\nPaperUI · NoteUI · SearchUI" as UI
rectangle "接口控制包\nAppAPI → preload → IPCHandler" as Bridge
rectangle "业务逻辑层／应用服务包\nWorkspaceController · SourceController\nRefreshController · PaperController\nNoteController · SearchController · IndexService" as Business
rectangle "数据访问层／数据持久化包\nWorkspaceDAO · FeedSourceDAO · FeedItemDAO\nPageDAO · BlockDAO · AttachmentDAO\nReferenceDAO · SearchDAO\nUnitOfWork · MigrationRunner" as DAO
database "数据库\nSQLite" as DB
rectangle "领域模型包\nWorkspace · FeedSource · FeedItem\nPage · NotePage · PaperPage\nBlock · Attachment · DTO" as Domain
rectangle "平台支撑包\nFileDialog · FileStore\nWorkspaceLock · FeedGateway\nExternalBrowser" as Platform
UI -down-> Bridge : 业务请求
Bridge -down-> Business : 参数与会话校验
Business -down-> DAO : 业务数据／Tx
DAO -down-> DB : 参数化查询／事务
UI ..> Domain : 显示数据
Business ..> Domain : 业务对象
DAO ..> Domain : 实体映射
Business -right-> Platform : 文件／网络／系统操作
DAO ..> Platform : 迁移保护副本
@enduml
